          "ccc": {
            "complaint": "CUSTOMER STATES THE PASSENGER FRONT SECTION IS FLOODED WITH WATER COMING FROM THE VEHICLE.    -CHECK AND ADVISE ",
            "complaintCode": "",
            "cause": "VERIFIED THE CUSTOMER CONCERN IS PRESENT. USING OUR WATER HOSE, ALLOWED WATER TO RUN FROM THE PASSENGERS SIDE OF THE SUNROOF AREA WHILE WE INSPECTED THE INSIDE FOR LEAKS. AFTER SOME TIME, FOUND WATER STARTED LEAKING FROM DRIVER SIDE AND PASSENGERS SIDE PILLERS. WATER WILL HIT THE SEAT AS WELL. REMOVED THE HOSE AND OPENED THE SUN ROOF TO INSPECT THE DRAINS. UPON INSPECTON FOUND BOTH DRAINS WERE CLOGGED. DUE TO THIS, WATER WAS POOLING UP AND CAUSING IT TO OVERFLOW INTO THE CABIN. CLEANED THE SUNROOF CHANNELS AND USED PRESSURIZED AIR TO CLEAR OUT THE DRAINS. USING THE WATER HOSE WE SET IT UP THE WAY I HAD IT BEFORE AND VERIFIED THE CONCERN IS NO LONGER PRESENT. RECOMMEND CUSTOMER PERFORMS INTERIOR DETAIL TO USE EXTRACTOR TO CLEAN UP AS MUCH WATER AS POSSIBLE BEFORE MOLD STARTS TO OCCUR. ",
            "correction": "CUSTOMER APPROVED TO HAVE INTERIOR DETAIL COMPLETED "
          },
